; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Nepali / नेपाली (ne)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

सार्नुहोस् counter 5

launch_loop:
प्रणाली_कल counter
घटाउनुहोस् counter 1
तुलना_गर्नुहोस् counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
सार्नुहोस् box 999
प्रणाली_कल box
